# ==========================================
# PROJECT: NETMON - NETWORK MONITORING SYSTEM
# DOMAIN: https://netmon.click
# STACK: Next.js 14 + Prisma + PostgreSQL + Redis + BullMQ + Tailwind + shadcn + framer-motion
# GOAL: NMS Multi-Tenant Pro. Bisa ON-PREMISE & CLOUD SAAS
# ==========================================

## 1. BRANDING WAJIB
1. NAMA PRODUK: NETMON
2. DOMAIN UTAMA: https://netmon.click
3. SUBDOMAIN CUSTOMER: {tenant}.netmon.click
4. WARNA BRAND: Primary #, Background #
5. LOGO: Text "NETMON" dengan icon radar/pulse

## 2. DESIGN SYSTEM & UI/UX
1. THEME: Default DARK MODE. Toggle di header
2. FONT: Inter + JetBrains Mono
3. KOMPONEN: shadcn/ui. Animasi framer-motion 200ms
4. LAYOUT: Sidebar collapsible + Header sticky + Global Search

## 3. DATABASE SCHEMA PRISMA - FINAL
model tenant {
 id String @id @default(cuid())
 name String
 slug String @unique // ini jadi subdomain. ex: acme.netmon.click
 domain String
 management_email String
 brand_color String? @default("#")
 logo_url String?
 device_limit Int @default(100)
 status String @default("active")
 plan String @default("cloud_basic")
}
model user {
 id String @id @default(cuid())
 tenant_id String
 email String @unique
 name String?
 role String @default("viewer") // superadmin, admin, operator, viewer
}
model device {
 id String @id @default(cuid())
 tenant_id String
 hostname String
 ip String
 type String
 status String @default("unknown")
 @@unique([tenant_id, hostname])
 @@unique([ip])
}
model device_link { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String from_device_id String to_device_id String status String @default("up") }
model alert { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String device_id String event String status String @default("firing") severity String @default("critical") created_at DateTime @default(now()) }
model sla { id String @id @default(cuid()) device_id String @unique uptime_30d Float @default(100) }
model metric { id String @id @default(cuid()) device_id String ts DateTime @default(now()) cpu_percent Float ram_percent Float disk_percent Float }
model dashboard { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String name String layout Json }
model audit_log { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String user_id String action String created_at DateTime @default(now()) }
model subscription { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String @unique status String }

## 4. DEPLOYMENT MODES
### MODE A: ON-PREMISE `docker-compose.onprem.yml`
Semua di server pelanggan. Akses: https://nms.perusahaan.com

### MODE B: CLOUD SAAS `docker-compose.cloud.yml`
Multi tenant di netmon.click. Akses: https://acme.netmon.click
Wajib setup wildcard DNS: *.netmon.click -> IP Server

## 5. MULTI-TENANCY & PORTAL
1. ISOLASI: SEMUA query `where: { tenant_id: auth.tenant_id }`
2. ROLES: superadmin, admin, operator, viewer
3. UI SPLIT: `/dashboard` untuk admin. `/portal` untuk viewer di subdomain tenant

## 6. 15 MODUL WAJIB
MODUL 1-4: POLLER, ALERT, SLA, TOPOLOGY
MODUL 5: IMPORT CSV/EXCEL
MODUL 6: BULK ACTIONS
MODUL 7: REPORT PDF
MODUL 8: STATUS PAGE /status/[tenant]
MODUL 9: SECURITY + 2FA + SSO
MODUL 10: AGENT
MODUL 11: DASHBOARD BUILDER
MODUL 12: PORTAL CUSTOMER /portal
MODUL 13: USER MANAGEMENT
MODUL 14: ONBOARDING /signup
MODUL 15: SUPERADMIN /admin

## 7. ENV WAJIB

DATABASE_URL=
REDIS_URL=
JWT_SECRET=
ENCRYPT_KEY=
IS_SAAS=false
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://netmon.click
APP_URL=https://netmon.click

*NEXT STEP SETELAH BELI DOMAIN*

1. *Setup DNS Wildcard* di Cloudflare/Niagahoster

 A Record: @ -> IP Server kamu
 A Record: * -> IP Server kamu

Biar `acme.netmon.click` langsung jalan

2. *Ganti http://di.env*

 NEXTAUTH_URL=https://netmon.click
 APP_URL=https://netmon.click

3. *SSL Otomatis*
 Pakai Traefik + Let's Encrypt biar `_.netmon.click` auto https

4. *Email Branding*
 Kirim alert dari `noreply@netmon.click`

*TAGLINE YANG COCOK BUAT http://NETMON.CLICK*
1. `NETMON - Your Network, Always On`
2. `NETMON - Click to Monitor Everything`
3. `NETMON - Enterprise Network Visibility`

